/* Device discovery for the Lapis bridge: asks the local network which Dante and RAVENNA devices are there,
   using multicast DNS (DNS-SD), the same way Dante Controller finds devices. Read-only: nothing is changed.
   The question is sent from a random port, so devices answer this program directly ("legacy unicast"),
   and it works next to macOS's own mDNS service. */

